<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia tenders to build marina.</title>
<headline>Tunisia tenders to build marina.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Monday launched an international tender to pre-qualify firms for building a marina south of the resort of Hammamet.</p>
<p>The tender is aimed at firms specialised in maritim works and setting up marinas.</p>
<p>Works would last two years.</p>
<p>The marina would be located south of Hammamet, one of the country's most frequented Mediterranean resorts. It is 60 km (37 miles) south of Tunis.</p>
</text>
